# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale sv
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as [05:00, 10:00).
# Sources: Svensk ordbok utgiven av Svenska Akademien
# (https://svenska.se/so/?id=115794), which gives eftermiddag as the
# "del av dagen som infaller mellan lunchtiden och kvallen".
# The definite singular is listed beside the bare noun because it is the
# everyday form ("i eftermiddagen", "under kvallen").
# The Nordic morgon is short -- five hours, handing over to formiddag well
# before noon -- and is not English's six-hour morning.
morgon
morgonen
